{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HER TREES : PUZZLE DREAM</strong> is a unique point-and-click puzzle game where you move and combine objects to solve puzzles. Unravel the strange puzzles hidden in your dreams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the third game in the series, but it can be enjoyed as a standalone title for newcomers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300800/extras/a1029a2acf7d42e061f3c3c06f4c2656.poster.avif?t=1771280208\" width=430 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300800/extras/a1029a2acf7d42e061f3c3c06f4c2656.webm?t=1771280208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300800/extras/a1029a2acf7d42e061f3c3c06f4c2656.mp4?t=1771280208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 unique puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Puzzles that can be solved through intuition and observation, with no tedious calculations or note-taking required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hints and solutions available after a certain amount of time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 1.5-3 hours of playtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For a diverse range of players:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-verbal game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely monochrome design, with puzzles that can be solved regardless of color perception</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No puzzles that rely on sound</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.stea